OL,3,GNEWSAFears quiet electric buses pose
OL,4,Adanger to blind people
OL,5,
OL,6,FFears have been raised that blind
OL,7,Fpedestrians might be at risk from
OL,8,Felectric buses that have been rolled
OL,9,Fout in Merseyside.
OL,11,FOne hundred vehicles will be part of a
OL,12,Ffleet of new low-emission buses which
OL,13,Fhave been bought by the Liverpool City
OL,14,FRegion Combined Authority (LCRCA).
OL,16,FA caller to BBC Radio Merseyside,
OL,17,FChris, from Huyton, said that as a
OL,18,Fblind man he was worried about how
OL,19,Fquiet the vehicles could be.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,407,400,260,160,0,100
