OL,3,GNEWSAFears quiet electric buses pose
OL,4,Adanger to blind people
OL,5,
OL,6,FMetropolitan mayor Steve Rotheram
OL,7,Facknowledged that the buses "were very,
OL,8,Fvery quiet", and said they should "emit
OL,9,Fsome kind of noise" to alert
OL,10,Fvisually-impaired pedestrians.
